flowchart TD
 A[Elapsed duration including pauses] --> B{duration > 35 s?}
 B -- Yes --> C[STOP: red / white]
 B -- No --> D{duration > 25 s?}
 D -- Yes --> E[LAND IT: gold / black]
 D -- No --> F[GOOD: green / white]
 C --> S[setState writes panel text and colors]
 E --> S
 F --> S
 M[Manual data-state button] --> S
 P[Documented 45 / 75 s: unresolved drift] -.-> A
